          %h2#idea Idea
          %p
            What is called
            %em massive type IIA supergravity
            or
            %em Romans supergravity
            (due to
            = succeed ")" do
              %a{:href => "#Romans86"} Romans 86
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/type+IIA+supergravity"} type IIA supergravity
            in which the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/B-field"} B-field
            acquires a
            = succeed "-term." do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/mass"} mass
          %h2#properties Properties
          %h3#lift_to_string_theory Lift to string theory
          %p
            The lift of Romans supergravity to to
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/string+theory"} string theory
            is known as
            = succeed "," do
              %em
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/massive+type+IIA+string+theory"} massive type IIA string theory
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/RR-field"} RR-field
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/flux+form"} flux form
            of degree 0 (or of degree 10 by
            = succeed ")" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Hodge+duality"} Hodge duality
            = succeed "." do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/D8-branes"} D8-branes
          %h3#black_d8brane_solutions Black D8-brane solutions
          %p
            The mass term makes Romans supergravity have
            = succeed "-solutions" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/black+brane"} black brane
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/D8-branes"} D8-branes
          %p
            (
            %a{:href => "#BergshoessdeRooGreenPapadopoulosTownsend96"}> Bergshoess-de Roo-Green-Papadopoulos-Townsend 96
            ,
            = succeed "," do
              %a{:href => "#ChamblinPerry97"} Chamblin-Perry 97
            = succeed ")" do
              %a{:href => "#JanssenMeessenOrtin99"} Janssen-Meessen-Ortin 99
          %p
            and to
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/D6-D8-brane+bound+states"} D6-D8-brane bound states
            (
            %a{:href => "#Singh02a"}> Singh 02a
            ,
            = succeed ")" do
              %a{:href => "#Singh02b"} Singh 02b
          %h2#related_concepts Related concepts
          %ul
            %li
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/massive+type+IIA+string+theory"} massive type IIA string theory
          %h2#related_concepts_2 Related concepts
          %ul
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/massive+type+IIA+string+theory"} massive type IIA string theory
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/D8-brane"} D8-brane
          %h2#references References
          %h3#general General
          %ul
            %li#Romans86
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/L.+J.+Romans"}> L. J. Romans
                ,
                %em
                  Massive
                  %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                    %semantics
                      %mrow
                        %mi N
                        %mo =
                        %mn 2
                        %mi a
                      %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} N = 2a
                  supergravity in ten dimensions
                , Physics Letters B Volume 169, Issue 4, 3 April 1986, Pages 374-380 (
                %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1016/0370-2693(86)90375-8"}> doi:10.1016/0370-2693(86)90375-8
                ,
                = succeed ")" do
                  %a{:href => "http://inspirehep.net/record/17727"} spire:17727
            %li#Tsimpis05
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Dimitrios+Tsimpis"}> Dimitrios Tsimpis
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Massive IIA supergravities
                = succeed ")" do
                  %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/hep-th/0508214"} arXiv:hep-th/0508214
          %h3#black_branes Black branes
          %h4#d8branes D8-branes
          %p
            As a
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/black+brane"} black brane
            the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/D8-brane"} D8-brane
            was identified as a solution to
            = succeed "/" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Romans+supergravity"} Romans supergravity
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/massive+type+IIA+string+theory"} massive type IIA string theory
            in
          %ul
            %li#BergshoeffdeBooGreenPapadopoulosTownsend96
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Eric+Bergshoeff"}> Eric Bergshoeff
              , Mees de Roo,
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Michael+Green"} Michael Green
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/George+Papadopoulos"} George Papadopoulos
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Paul+Townsend"} Paul Townsend
              = succeed "," do
                %em Duality of Type II 7-branes and 8-branes
              = succeed ")" do
                %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/hep-th/9601150"} arXiv:hep-th/9601150
          %p See also
          %ul
            %li#ChamblinPerry97
              %p
                A. Chamblin,
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Malcolm+Perry"} Malcolm Perry
                %em Dynamic D8-branes in IIA string theory
                (
                %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/hep-th/9712112"}> arXiv:hep-th/9712112
                )
            %li#JanssenMeessenOrtin99
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Bert+Janssen"}> Bert Janssen
                , Patrick Meessen,
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Tomas+Ortin"} Tomas Ortin
                = succeed "," do
                  %em The D8-brane tied up: String and brane solutions in massive type IIA supergravity
                = succeed "," do
                  %a{:href => "http://inspirehep.net/record/494174"} spire:494174
                = succeed ")" do
                  %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1016/S0370-2693(99)00315-9"} doi:10.1016/S0370-2693(99)00315-9
          %h4#D6D8BoundStates D6-D8-brane bound states
          %p
            On
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/D6-D8-brane+bound+states"} D6-D8-brane bound states
            in
            = succeed ":" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/massive+type+IIA+string+theory"} massive type IIA string theory
          %ul
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Harvendra+Singh"}> Harvendra Singh
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %em
                    Duality symmetric massive type II theories in
                    %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                      %semantics
                        %mrow
                          %mi D
                          %mo =
                          %mn 8
                        %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} D=8
                    and
                    %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                      %semantics
                        %mrow
                          %mi D
                          %mo =
                          %mn 6
                        %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} D=6
                = succeed ")" do
                  %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/hep-th/0109147"} arXiv:hep-th/0109147
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Harvendra+Singh"}> Harvendra Singh
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Note on (D6,D8) Bound State, Massive Duality and Non-commutativity
                = succeed ")" do
                  %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/hep-th/0212103"} arXiv:hep-th/0212103
            %li
              %p
                Fabio Apruzzi,
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Marco+Fazzi"} Marco Fazzi
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Alessandro+Tomasiello"} Alessandro Tomasiello
                = succeed "," do
                  %em
                    All
                    %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                      %semantics
                        %mrow
                          %msub
                            %mi AdS
                            %mn 7
                        %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} AdS_7
                    solutions of type II supergravity
                = succeed ")" do
                  %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/1309.2949"} arxiv:1309.2949
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Marco+Fazzi"}> Marco Fazzi
                ,
                %em Higher-dimensional field theories from type II supergravity
                (
                %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/1712.04447"}> arxiv:1712.04447
                )
          %p
            With emphasis on
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/charge+quantization"} charge quantization
            of the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/RR-field"} RR-field
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/flux"} flux
            forms via
            = succeed ":" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/bundle+gerbes"} bundle gerbes
          %ul
            %li
